msgstr "发送游戏"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:53
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr "选择游戏的文件夹：它会被发送到PC5的INSTALL文件夹，然后PC5会询问是否安装。"

